Two switches the product was missing, and a way out of the room

The dashboard carries shared cockpit as a choice rather than a fact: off, the link is stopped,
the room is left, the ports are closed, and asking for an invite says so instead of handing one
out. On, it all comes back without a restart. The aircraft's own switches got a card of their
own - the bridge on or off, which names this airframe may be asked for, whether the room hears
what the sim reports, and buttons that put the community page in the folder you named, or take
out the one Tandem made.
